{%- doc -%}
  Styles for the Black Friday hero lines (homepage hero, Figma 5056:3809 mobile): the offer line under the
  icons and the shipping lines under the button. They are Custom Liquid blocks in the hero (text editable there):
    <p class="somna-hero-line somna-hero-line--offer">…<b>60% off</b>…</p>
    <p class="somna-hero-line somna-hero-line--ship">…</p>
  Both show on phones only (the desktop design has neither). Also hides the hero's offer badge on phones,
  as in the mobile design.
{%- enddoc -%}
<style>
  /* the Custom Liquid block's wrapper is hidden too, so it leaves no gap on desktop */
  div:has(> .somna-hero-line) { display: none; }
  .somna-hero-line { margin: 0; text-align: center; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    div:has(> .somna-hero-line) { display: block; width: 100%; }
    .somna-hero-line--offer { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.3; color: #f3feee; }
    .somna-hero-line--offer b { font-weight: 700; color: #afbdf8; }
    .somna-hero-line--ship { margin-top: -8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; color: #848484; }
    .hero-wrapper:has(.somna-hero-line) .somna-badge { display: none; }
    /* phone type sizes from the mobile design: big two-line offer, one-line strapline */
    .hero-wrapper:has(.somna-hero-line) h1 { max-width: 300px; margin-inline: auto; font-size: 42px !important; line-height: 1.35 !important; }
    .hero-wrapper:has(.somna-hero-line) h2 { font-size: 16.4px !important; line-height: 1.35 !important; }
    /* the taller copy pushes the pouches photo down a little so the lines under the button stay clear of it */
    .hero-wrapper:has(.somna-hero-line) img.hero__media { object-position: 50% 40px !important; }
  }
</style>
